	<section_number>20-69</section_number>
	<catch_line>Fees of officers</catch_line>
	<text>
		The officers acting under this chapter shall be entitled to the same fees as are now or hereafter allowed in misdemeanor cases.
	</text>
	<history>1944, p. 212; Michie Suppl. 1946, § 1937c; 1974, c. 464.</history>
